# 🚀 NAZM - Build & Deployment Guide

نَظْم · NAZM — Intelligence Hub

Complete guide for building and deploying to Web, Mobile, and Desktop.

-----

## 📋 Prerequisites

```bash
# Node.js 18+ and npm/yarn
node --version  # v18.0.0+
npm --version   # 8.0.0+

# Install dependencies
npm install
```

-----

## 🌐 Web App (Web Browser)

### Development

```bash
npm run dev
# Opens http://localhost:5173
```

### Build for Production

```bash
npm run build
# Output: dist/

# Preview production build
npm run preview
```

### Deployment to Vercel

```bash
# Install Vercel CLI
npm install -g vercel

# Deploy
vercel
# Select "dist" as build output directory
```

### Deployment to Netlify

```bash
# Create vercel.json or netlify.toml
# Copy dist/ to deployment

# Using Netlify CLI
npm install -g netlify-cli
netlify deploy --prod --dir=dist
```

### Deployment to GitHub Pages

```bash
# Update vite.config.js
# base: '/nazm-app/'

npm run build

# Push dist/ to gh-pages branch
git subtree push --prefix dist origin gh-pages
```

