## 🪟 Windows / macOS / Linux Desktop

### Development

```bash
# Terminal 1: Start dev server
npm run dev

# Terminal 2: Start Electron (waits for server)
npm run dev:all
```

### Build Standalone Executable

```bash
# Build everything
npm run build:all

# Create installers for all platforms
npm run dist:all

# Platform-specific builds
npm run dist:win    # Windows NSIS installer + portable
npm run dist:mac    # macOS DMG
npm run dist:linux  # Linux AppImage + DEB
```

### Output Files

After `npm run dist:all`:

```
dist/
├── NAZM-1.0.0.exe          # Windows installer
├── NAZM-1.0.0-portable.exe # Windows portable
├── NAZM-1.0.0.dmg          # macOS installer
├── NAZM-1.0.0.AppImage     # Linux AppImage
└── nazm-1.0.0-1_amd64.deb  # Linux DEB package
```

### Code Signing (Production)

**Windows:**

```bash
# Set environment variables before build
export WIN_CSC_LINK="/path/to/certificate.pfx"
export WIN_CSC_KEY_PASSWORD="password"

npm run dist:win
```

**macOS:**

```bash
# Requires Apple Developer certificate
export APPLE_ID="your-email@example.com"
export APPLE_PASSWORD="your-app-password"
export ASC_PROVIDER="your-team-id"

npm run dist:mac
```

