## 🆘 Troubleshooting

### Service Worker Issues

```bash
# Clear all caches
application.clear()

# Re-register
navigator.serviceWorker.getRegistrations().then(r => r.forEach(x => x.unregister()))
```

### Electron Build Fails

```bash
# Clean build
rm -rf dist node_modules
npm install
npm run build:all
```

### API Timeout

Increase timeout in `.env.local`:

```env
VITE_API_TIMEOUT=30000  # 30 seconds
```

